# The ONE recipe the committed WASM pkg (citadel-workspace-client-ts/pkg) is built with.
#
# TYPES-SYNC D3, measured 2026-11-19 (run 44557022429): three clean builds on
# three GitHub runners (two ubuntu-24.04, one ubuntu-22.04) with these versions
# were byte-identical in every pkg file. A build on a developer Mac with the
# same versions was NOT: it embeds that machine's $CARGO_HOME in panic
# locations (/Users/<name>/.cargo/... against /home/runner/.cargo/...), and
# wasm-bindgen's symbol hashes differ (cargo's metadata hash includes the host).
# So the committed pkg is the Linux CI build, and wasm-rebuild-diff holds it to
# that: scripts/regenerate-committed-pkg.sh, with exactly these versions.
#
# Read by scripts/install-wasm-toolchain.sh (CI) and checked by
# scripts/regenerate-committed-pkg.sh. Changing one is a pkg regeneration.
WASM_RUST_TOOLCHAIN=1.100.0
WASM_PACK_VERSION=0.13.1
